<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81020" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιαγγέλλω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>announce by messages sent round</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἐκεχειρίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.122
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούτων περιαγγελλομένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.1
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὸ γεγονός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.58
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs.,
			<i>send</i> or <i>carry a message round</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.119
			</span></i>; 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρήγγελκεν</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c.
				inf., <i>send round orders for</i> people
			<i>to</i> do something, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιήγγελλον κατὰ τὴν Πελοπόννησον . .
					στρατιὰν παρασκευάζεσθαι ταῖς πόλεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ δὲ ναυτικῷ περιήγγειλαν . .
				ὡς τάχιστα πλεῖν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				80
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιήγγελλον . . κατὰ τὴν Πελοπόννησον
					βοηθεῖν ὅτι τάχιστα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.116
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				6.4.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. οὐχ ὑποκαίειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ephipp.
					5.18
				</span></i>
			 (s. v.l.): with inf. omitted, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς περιήγγελλον κατὰ πόλεις</span>,
				= Lat. <i>imperabant naves</i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.85
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίδηρον π. κατὰ τοὺς ξυμμάχους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.18
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
